"Read and discuss the picture book Dear Earth... From Your Friends in Room 5, with a themed snack. Registration required.": "Lee y comenta el libro ilustrado Dear Earth... From Your Friends in Room 5, con un bocadillo temático. Inscripción obligatoria.",
